poc.py: offline PoC. A local HTTP server stands in for the Gemini API and answers every request
with HTTP 400. It streams once through litellm.acompletion and once through litellm.Router.acompletion
(same deployment, num_retries=0) and prints the exception type each raises.

repro.sh <python>: runs poc.py with that interpreter; exit 1 = bug reproduces, 0 = fixed, 2 = cannot decide.
